An exchange without a default commodity warns when only the incoming holding has a price.

========== API ==========

aggregate()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity NEW
  format 1,000.000000 NEW
commodity OLD
  format 1,000.0000 OLD
account Assets:Shares
account Equity:Opening
2022-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Shares  1.9619 OLD {{350 SEK}}
  Equity:Opening  -350 SEK
2022-12-12 Replacement
  Assets:Shares  4.051281 NEW {{350 SEK}} @@ 350 SEK
  Assets:Shares  -1.9619 OLD {{350 SEK}}

========== WARNINGS ==========

[MISSING_DEFAULT_COMMODITY] Journal must declare one default commodity
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:1:1

[UNBALANCED_TRANSACTION] Transaction does not balance: 350 SEK, -1.9619 OLD
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:12:1
